Source:  https://github.com/moby/moby
File:    daemon/pkg/oci/defaults.go
Commit:  9fabd6dfbb926381278c436a866bc8d6ac222274

What was derived: only the path strings of the default OCI
linux.readonlyPaths (5 entries: /proc/bus, /proc/fs, /proc/irq,
/proc/sys, /proc/sysrq-trigger) and the /proc entries (10 entries) of
the default linux.maskedPaths, plus the two fixed /sys entries of the
default linux.maskedPaths (/sys/devices/virtual/powercap and
/sys/firmware) and the per-CPU path form
/sys/devices/system/cpu/cpuN/thermal_throttle (issue #2014). No logic
was copied. The corresponding definition file in this repository for
the readonlyPaths entries (issue #1850), the maskedPaths entries
(issue #1851) and the /sys entries (issue #2014) is
crates/core/src/path_masks.rs.

